DATA SOURCES (each bound through a ViewModel exposing StateFlow from the KMP core, P1/S8)
  useMotorLatest  GET /motor/latest [vehicle_id]
      → DrivingDynamicsPageViewModel.motorState (StateFlow<UiState<MotorLive?>>)
        ← DrivingDynamicsPageSource.motorLatest ← VehiclesStore.motorLatest (shared S8, ADR-013).
  useMotorHistory GET /motor [vehicle_id, limit=200]
      → DrivingDynamicsPageViewModel.motorHistory (StateFlow<MotorHistoryDerived> = chart samples +
        CanonicalMotorStats) ← DrivingDynamicsPageSource.motorHistory ← VehiclesStore.motorHistory.
  useDrives       GET /drives [vehicle_id]
      → DrivingDynamicsPageViewModel.drives (StateFlow<DrivesDerived> = SpeedGearPanel samples +
        DriveAnalyticsSection drives) ← DrivingDynamicsPageSource.drives ← HttpDrivingRepository.drives.
  useDrivingCoach GET /analytics/driving-coach [vehicle_id, days]
      → DrivingDynamicsPageViewModel.coach (StateFlow<DrivingCoachData?>)
        ← DrivingDynamicsPageSource.drivingCoach ← HttpDrivingRepository.drivingCoach.
  (sub-panel feeds, web-faithful)
  useDriveDynamicsLatest → DrivingDynamicsPageViewModel.driveDynamics (StateFlow<DriveDynamicsLive?>)
